+  /// Where the Desktop shows, what floats on it shows, and where it does not, it does not. The two are a column beside a Desktop without room, and a
+  /// view of the two alone shows neither. One of them goes and comes back: the room is kept, and empty, and there and back is nothing.
+  @Test(arguments: [false, true]) func aViewOfTheTwoAloneShowsNothingThatFloatsWhileOneIsAway(held: Bool) {
+    let (h, w) = harness(3)
